<title>AZERBAIJAN: SOCCER-HUNGARY WINS 3 TO 0 AGAINST AZERBAIJAN.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-HUNGARY WINS 3 TO 0 AGAINST AZERBAIJAN.</headline>
<dateline>BAKU 1996-11-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary won 3 to 0 against Azerbaijan in their World Cup European group three qualifying match on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorers: Elek Nyilas 43 and 70, Florian Urban 82.</p>
<p>Time of last two goals were confirmed by Hungarian news agency MTI.</p>
